OL,3,GNEWSAArctic Corsair to open for
OL,4,Avisitors next spring
OL,5,
OL,6,FArctic Corsair, built in Beverley in
OL,7,F1960, was involved in the Cod Wars with
OL,8,FIceland in the 1970s. In 1973, it broke
OL,9,Fthe world record for landing the
OL,10,Fgreatest weight of cod and haddock from
OL,11,Fthe White Sea, according to Hull
OL,12,FMaritime.
